sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as Player
    participant W as Website
    participant API as Identity workflow
    participant D as Discord
    P->>W: Sign in
    W->>API: Begin Discord authorization
    API-->>W: Authorization redirect with request correlation
    W->>D: Request player consent
    D-->>W: Return authorization result
    W->>API: Complete correlated sign-in
    API->>D: Validate authorization and obtain Discord identity
    alt Denied or invalid authorization
        API-->>W: Sign-in failed with retry guidance
        W-->>P: Show failure
    else Authorized
        API->>API: Resolve local user and community permissions
        API-->>W: Establish authenticated application session
        W->>API: Query pending character claims
        alt Pending claims exist
            API-->>W: Open mandatory approval page
        else No pending claims
            API-->>W: Open community raid view
        end
    end
